Package: TriSmart
Type: Package
Title: Hybrid Zone-Aware Imputation for Proteomics Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Yu", "Jiang", email = "yjiang4@memphis.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Classifies proteins into abundance and missingness zones and
    applies a three-stage hybrid imputation workflow. The workflow combines
    multivariate imputation for high-abundance proteins, elastic-net models
    for proteins with mixed missingness, and left-censoring methods for
    low-abundance proteins while preserving all observed values.
